### ==========================================
### ADMIN - POSTS
### ==========================================

### List Posts

GET http://localhost:8000/api/admin/posts
Accept: application/json

### Create Post

POST http://localhost:8000/api/admin/posts
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Best AI Tools for Developers",
    "slug": "best-ai-tools-for-developers-2",
    "category_id": 1,
    "excerpt": "A practical guide to the best AI tools for developers.",
    "content": "This is our first affiliate article.",
    "post_type": "article",
    "status": "draft",
    "reading_time": 5,
    "allow_comments": false
}

### Get Post

GET http://localhost:8000/api/admin/posts/2
Accept: application/json

### Update Post

PUT http://localhost:8000/api/admin/posts/2
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Best AI Tools for Developers in 2026",
    "status": "published",
    "reading_time": 7
}

### Delete Post

DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/admin/posts/2
Accept: application/json